cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or cite KSODI, please cite the canonical public repository."
title: "KSODI v3.5.0: Public Reference Release"
version: "3.5.0"
date-released: "2026-08-12"
authors:
  - family-names: "Steinacker-Folkerts"
    given-names: "Anne"
  - family-names: "Folkerts"
    given-names: "Heiko"
abstract: >-
  KSODI (Kontextsensitive Semantische Operatoren fuer Digitale Interaktion) is
  a structured, non-normative observation method for interaction dynamics in
  human-AI and multi-agent settings. This v3.5.0 public reference release
  includes KSODI-Light, the complete monadic Standard-Eval line
  (K0/S0/O0/D0/I0, Z(t), IK) and the opened dyadic branch with R0 and IK_rel.
  Later R-family layers remain staged research.
keywords:
  - interaction dynamics
  - human-AI interaction
  - multi-agent systems
  - observability
  - AI governance
  - communication theory
repository-code: "https://github.com/Alkiri-dAraion/KSODI-Public"
url: "https://github.com/Alkiri-dAraion/KSODI-Public"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
